Mujhe availability ka logic samjhao aur implement karo.

For example, agar 3 projectors hain aur 2 already borrowed hain, to available quantity 1 honi chahiye.

User available quantity se zyada equipment request nahi kar sake.

Date-based booking ke case me overlapping bookings bhi prevent karni hain.


Ek borrowing limit bhi add karo. Requirement ye hai ki ek student ke paas maximum 5 active equipment units ho sakte hain.

Approval se pehle check karo:

Current active units + requested units

Agar 5 se zyada ho raha hai to request reject honi chahiye.

Ab return functionality implement karo aur late fee calculate karo.

Late fee sirf due date ke baad return karne par lagegi.

Use:

Late Days = max(0, Actual Return Date - Due Date)

Late Fee = Late Days × Late Fee Per Day

Early ya on-time return par late fee nahi lagni chahiye.



Deposit ka bhi proper logic add karo.

Equipment return hone ke baad late fee deposit se deduct hogi.

Refund Amount = max(0, Deposit Amount - Late Fee)

Deposit amount, late fee, refundable amount aur refund status database me track hona chahiye.


